    primarySourceCitation: "300th Anniversary of Zumbi's Death → Brazilian Black Consciousness Day (Salvador, Bahia, Brazil, 1995); Source: 2 (Zumbi coronation records, Palmares colonial correspondence) + 3 (João José Reis, *Palmares: A Cultural History*) + 3 (Kabengele Munanga, *O Antirracismo no Brasil*)",
